{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a55cd6cc7d93bbebe5dd9f0eea39d4da072a63f90db7d083789956cfce32169", "ja": "（ジュリアの新しい衣装が完成した。\n今はフィッティングをしてもらっている）", "zh": "（茱莉亚的新衣服做好了。现在正在试穿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "f228bf147a6961ec9bf0d6329f860016d0a166b0f302c004414a080e90302d47", "ja": "へぇ、面白い衣装だな。不思議の国のアリスがベース\nなのにロックな雰囲気もあって……気に入ったよ！", "zh": "哦，这套衣服真有意思。虽然以《爱丽丝梦游仙境》为基础，却又带着摇滚的感觉……我喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c66936d24a8d6f032e6261479e87a634f86a4a6e8ccc256f7065a6eb33bec006", "ja": "……なるほど。このくらいの可愛さなら、\nジュリアも照れずに着てくれるのか。メモしないと。", "zh": "……原来如此。要是这种程度的可爱，\n茱莉亚就不会害羞，肯穿上身啊。得记下来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "e5cb2ced2079d37695c62163fee6213f0d84a1f29f6278bc381e0cf90020f6b1", "ja": "お、おい！　なにメモってんだ！\nあたしだって、毎回照れてるわけじゃない……と思う。", "zh": "喂、喂！你在记什么呢！\n我也不是每次都会害羞……大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "152c65aa4cc4f9fc75401d0fd9454e281aa07c6264a89e231af87e1796f537c7", "ja": "それに気に入ったって言ったのも、なんていうか……\nこいつはあたしが着なきゃって思ったんだ。", "zh": "而且，说喜欢它也是，怎么说呢……  \n我觉得这东西非得由我来穿不可。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "e81e255d2fe7d362a31e35ed6a9fbbb590982cb6d8f5b8c028d85ba6ed858a80", "ja": "『アリスとロックの融合』なんて、ぶっ飛んだテーマ。\nなかなかお目にかかれないだろ？", "zh": "“爱丽丝与摇滚的融合”这种异想天开的主题，\n可不是轻易就能见到的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9a77810f658fa7796b76fe8834827a7354f76b1ba90acb1635ca31e8d6cabdfe", "ja": "はは、確かに。\n本来なら交じり合わない題材だよな。", "zh": "哈哈，确实。\n这本来就是两种不会交融的题材。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "527f5316a395e8d28a907f0e6ac98542e978ff24e48d10152e651abb593daf51", "ja": "ああ。可愛い衣装を着こなせるやつは、たくさんいる。\nロックな衣装だって、同じだ。でも……。", "zh": "是啊。能驾驭可爱服装的人有很多。\n摇滚风的服装也是一样。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "30802821912d9d002f4d47f6f3b0322e7337ea2591a58f2c8b17eca3b005cd06", "ja": "アリスとロック……両方を背負えるアイドルは、\nそんなに居ないと思うんだ。……あたし以外には。", "zh": "能同时驾驭爱丽丝风和摇滚风的偶像，我觉得可没那么多。……除了我以外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c16c5fbd95b0d55e45fdcd0f538c832880dbbf60987b7ab3a345640a2d4aa6f3", "ja": "ほほう。自信があるわけだな？\n自分なら、その二大テーマを完璧に両立できるって。", "zh": "哦？看来你很有自信嘛？觉得自己能把那两大主题完美兼顾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "670734434aad3473d8dff6ced5538033892d85f52f8e3f03b0113f808f45e374", "ja": "完璧って……。そこまで確信があるわけじゃないさ。\nただ、他のアイドルよりはって意気込みの話だよ。", "zh": "完美什么的……我也没那么笃定啦。\n只是想表示自己有比其他偶像更拼的气势罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1637ee68e6701059f1fa1cc33f756c8630a7111ec5bcfca902abd338f6871a5a", "ja": "ジュリア、そんな風に……。\nありがとう、嬉しいよ！", "zh": "茱莉亚，你这么说……谢谢，我很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "31b207e38596668e25339c58b62e688354171920af1caa3494103c5265ed9d52", "ja": "うん？　嬉しい……？", "zh": "嗯？开心……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1013_p", "source_sha256": "922612f667fdb27f54429587b05a3e5a125a1cefc250803cb20383d6d6e61017", "ja": "ああ！　つまり、ロックだけじゃなくて、\n可愛さもバッチリ表現してくれるってことだもんな！", "zh": "没错！也就是说，不光是摇滚，连可爱也能完美表现出来，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "f3e94009d5e14386161eae5e9f58d25df762e5da393574552d1b705a44e13428", "ja": "うえっ！？　あ、あたし、そんなこといったか……？\nいや、言った、か……。あちゃー。", "zh": "呃！？我、我有说过那种话吗……？\n不对，好像是说过……哎呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "cb057ae0ba9836d770f80d34594256acf665e714162196caaeed9ed60e4561c7", "ja": "でも嘘は言ってないか。その、可愛さって部分も\nアイドル活動で、それなりに磨いてきたしな。", "zh": "不过，我也没说谎吧。可爱这一点，我也通过偶像活动磨炼得相当不错了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2aad8225a1b929b31411f56a4f7125aa6ea2d0fa869edcf0e39353516b94fcc5", "ja": "うんうん、そうだな。ジュリアがその衣装で、\nどんなステージを見せてくれるか、今から楽しみだよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，确实如此。现在就开始期待茱莉亚穿着那套服装，会带来怎样的舞台表演了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "32d935b96729de210eb0c5d658956d20da9672d2e822ab8761e7bafde675ae3d", "ja": "くっ、ニヤニヤしやがって……。けど、\nここで弱気になるのは、あたしの流儀じゃない。", "zh": "啧，笑得那么得意……不过，在这里退缩可不是我的作风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0644_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0644_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "580000c20e4e707fca21434962b1177245c522c4e89564eadb07873faa782651", "ja": "アイドルとロック、どっちも全力でやってきた\nあたしだからできるパフォーマンス、見せてやるよ！", "zh": "作为偶像和摇滚歌手，我一直都在全力以赴，\n所以才能展现出只有我能做到的表演给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
